{"project_id": "0df49dd5-9513-419d-be80-d2bbb8c2c993", "panels": [{"scene_id": "9ce54cac-a1a4-4a9d-ba9d-c403cb979dd8", "shot_type": "Wide", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_bb1668cd48c9.png", "segments": [{"id": "d023fb9d-811c-4204-b3c5-52473e3f517d", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "It was a morning day in the examination hall.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_1b424c54.mp3"}, {"id": "cd521a5f-72de-41a2-805e-bcd3b68a0c6e", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "Stationary, the sun rays were falling into the hall.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_a59cb24f.mp3"}, {"id": "7dfca177-03b1-47f4-8a71-0bce074ec9bb", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "Many students were anxious, but Jay was prepared.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_fcc8a9b9.mp3"}, {"id": "d1f60de2-7e30-4aaf-80c3-b32f510774ad", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "He was neatly organizing his stationary, calculator and pen on his desk.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_f04fd729.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "9ce54cac-a1a4-4a9d-ba9d-c403cb979dd8", "shot_type": "Medium", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_8db1403cff42.png", "segments": [{"id": "8bcc3901-8082-4514-a08d-6951f4fe405e", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "A girl named Kiran enters the classroom.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_745f30af.mp3"}, {"id": "1c1e56f2-8ad7-42f2-9d02-b4e7a723f986", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "She is disorganized and all over the place.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_1b3c9884.mp3"}, {"id": "119e5f00-be7d-4add-b045-249164918740", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "She hurriedly puts on her ID card, pen, and papers.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_2a58b12c.mp3"}, {"id": "e8d28ff9-3716-430d-8f79-da24c27c4124", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "She rushes towards the desk, which coincidentally is beside Jay.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_9fcff897.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "9ce54cac-a1a4-4a9d-ba9d-c403cb979dd8", "shot_type": "Close-up", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_12be690393c9.png", "segments": [{"id": "38850e1f-d241-45f9-9840-8f8ae64a723b", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "Jay, not knowing so, looks at her weirdly while she approaches him.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_cc2f5dfd.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "f95f6f6d-acfa-444b-a566-613883a508db", "shot_type": "Wide", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_efac40b4b17f.png", "segments": [{"id": "b8f85625-3fee-4ca6-b483-542ce4ef66d5", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "The story starts in Jay's room, a place filled with darkness and disarray.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_6bb6d0c2.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "f95f6f6d-acfa-444b-a566-613883a508db", "shot_type": "Close-up", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_db64f51ed4fe.png", "segments": [{"id": "787b346f-a91e-40da-a764-ba563a8634f8", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "He hears his alarm ringing and wakes up.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_192e6daa.mp3"}, {"id": "13ee50de-5520-40cc-998c-ec9cb6cd4cc9", "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "Jay", "text": "Ugh, not again.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_38e4e0df.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "f95f6f6d-acfa-444b-a566-613883a508db", "shot_type": "Medium", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_0b5f425c7179.png", "segments": [{"id": "c8271bc1-f710-4f42-845b-cc23b5acf597", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "He surveys his surroundings; the things he ate and everything he owned are cluttered in bed, a sign of his rough phase.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_f59adc4c.mp3"}, {"id": "0027cb4e-6fcf-4516-9636-b7b23317ed40", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "He broke up with Simran, the love of his life, a beautiful and charming young lady.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_10b4c4f2.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "dd5b9a0c-1eb2-467b-98d0-6f32650ecb60", "shot_type": "Establishing", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_140d04d59449.png", "segments": [{"id": "bef71470-76c1-4fde-b280-cd04da30b236", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "After the exam is over, the girl comes to talk to Jay.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_cf266ad1.mp3"}, {"id": "15ab2ada-4dbe-4632-9e31-8fec96927f1f", "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "girl", "text": "Hey, can you drop me home?", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_1a40bb09.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "dd5b9a0c-1eb2-467b-98d0-6f32650ecb60", "shot_type": "Close-up", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_3f9877993c6d.png", "segments": [{"id": "269fc66b-43c8-445a-91ec-635233cc4d9d", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "Jay hesitated, his mind racing with thoughts of Simran, but he nodded slowly, unsure of what to say next.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_0e420d0c.mp3"}]}, {"scene_id": "dd5b9a0c-1eb2-467b-98d0-6f32650ecb60", "shot_type": "Medium", "image_url": "/comics/cinematic_4c87bbe2ee91.png", "segments": [{"id": "f9abe829-98be-40eb-acff-b0c4a1906687", "type": "dialogue", "speaker": "girl", "text": "Are you okay?", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_4c92b0c6.mp3"}, {"id": "a8f4de01-f6be-4b47-ba96-c2b077127022", "type": "narration", "speaker": null, "text": "Jay swallowed hard, feeling the weight of his uncertainty pressing down on him.", "audio_url": "/audio/animatic/cine_1e9bd585.mp3"}]}], "character_voices": {"Jay": "en-US-GuyNeural", "Narrator": "en-US-JennyNeural"}, "background_music": "/audio/ambient/dramatic_tension.mp3", "metadata": {"cinematic": true, "aspect_ratio": "16:9", "total_shots": 9}}